#==============================================================================================
#
#   role_type - ARIA::RoleType: the base of the role classes, their global states and
#               properties, their JSON form, and the role object of a role
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/ARIA/RoleType.cpp (lines 1-349) with RoleType.h's inline
#       virtuals and constructor. The role classes (generated/aria/aria_roles.lucb, written by
#       tools/gen_aria_roles) override the virtuals; they use the two helpers of the first
#       section, which stand for C++'s vptr and for its function-local static hash tables.
